{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard and a $100 loan from a very shady lender. Is that all you\u2019ll need to launch your empire and get filthy rich?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and <i>invest</i> in a questionable workforce \u2014 from panhandlers and crypto miners to stray cats with ambition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the stock market... or gamble your fortune in <i>less conventional</i> ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge documents, dodge taxes, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead. Ethics are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your company! Grow your tiny shack into a ridiculous corporate powerhouse with more money than morals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring <strong>jaw-droppingly realistic</strong> graphics, get a taste of what it's like to be a ruthless, exploitative entrepreneur in this game that scored a perfect 10 according to my grandma, Gigi.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822840?t=1752190852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822840?t=1752190852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822840/d45fc4fd090d0e85c43eb1cc11dd14cb6f6303d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752190852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822840/d45fc4fd090d0e85c43eb1cc11dd14cb6f6303d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752190852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard 